        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Narrow Stile Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device, Adams Rite 8211-36</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8200 Series Narrow Stile Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device is designed for narrow stile aluminum applications that require a life-safety exit device with surface vertical rods for two-point locking.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Adams Rite 8211-36 Narrow Stile Rim Exit Device:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified Grade 1 ANSI/BHMA A156.3</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Clear Anodized Satin Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-15/16” max., 1-15/16” dogged</li>\r\n<li>Bar Height: Adjustable 30\" - 44\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: up to 8'</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Stile: 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4” to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Dogging: hex key standard</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. Packaged as Exit Device Only - No Trim.</i> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Special ordered item -- NO returns</B> \r\n</p>",
